==Icelandic==
{{cardinalbox|is|10|11|12|tíu|tólf|ord=ellefti}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|ellifu}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*ainalif}}, a compound of {{m|gem-pro|*ainaz}} and {{m|gem-pro|*-lif}}. Compare {{cog|fo|ellivu}}, Norwegian and Danish {{m|nb|elleve}}, Swedish {{m|sv|elva}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɛtlɛvʏ/|lang=is}}

===Numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# [[eleven]]; the cardinal number after {{m|is|tíu||ten}} and before {{m|is|tólf||twelve}}.

